MT7668 DKMS package
===================

Install the headers matching your kernel before installing this package.
Provide the required firmware separately under /lib/firmware/.

Disable the kernel's btmtksdio driver as described in README.md, then load:

    modprobe bt_mt7668
    modprobe wlan_mt76x8_sdio

DKMS rebuilds both modules when a supported kernel and its headers are installed.
See README.md for source, build and release information.
